title Vinyl hidden and shown again (X-Background=run): no drawing while hidden, the music goes on, a full repaint on return
sizes 640x480
lifecycle
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing

wait 800
hide
expect hidden
stale space
wait 600
expect nowrite
show
expect visible
wait 400
expect repaint
shot after-show
close
expect quit
